    "summary": "Portrait of a woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. Woman wearing a striped jacket, purple and white blouse and bright pink skirt. On her head is a feather and jewelled head-dress and a blue veil trails down her back. Her hands are hennaed. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
